VII. Death

If this cohabitation agreement is still in effect, each partner agrees that with
the death of one partner, and after payment of that partner's bills, debts and
expenses, all remaining property will be distributed according to the attached
inheritance agreement (Will and Testament).

VIII. Reconciliation

Cohabitation reconciliation can be effected simply by each partner signing a new
